    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Spellblades, gishes, arcane knights, and eldritch tricksters all. Magi are arcane specialists that blend magic and martial prowess.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Magi</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Alucard, Castlevania</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Elric of Melniboné, Stormbringer</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Geralt of Rivia, The Witcher</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Twilight Suzuka, Outlaw Star</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Magus</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The magus may be a bit more challenging for newer players. Their playstyle is more build-dependent than the other classes, allowing for backline blasters, midline harassers, and frontline strikers.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Attack/Cast</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Flexible</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Arcana, Melee</span></p>",
